==Reception==
The series received mostly mixed reviews.<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |title=Un Extraño Enemigo ya tiene primeras críticas y reacciones |url=https://www.tomatazos.com/articulos/348878/Un-Extrano-Enemigo-ya-tiene-primeras-criticas-y-reacciones |access-date=2022-07-26 |website=Tomatazos |language=es}}</ref> Although some praised it for its cinematography, others deeply criticised its portrayal of the student protests by "over-simplyfying" the events of 1968, "focusing too much on the government conspiracy"<ref name=":0" /> and putting forth a notion of a [[deep state]] in Mexico, distorting how the events unfolded, making it ultimately [[Institutional Revolutionary Party|PRI]] propaganda.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Un extraño enemigo y la conspiración diazordacista |url=http://www.laizquierdadiario.mx/Un-extrano-enemigo-y-la-conspiracion-diazordacista |access-date=2022-07-26 |website=La Izquierda Diario |language=es}}</ref>

==Cast and crew==
The series is produced by filmmaker [[Gabriel Ripstein]],<ref>{{Cite web | url=https://www.eluniversal.com.mx/espectaculos/natasha-ahonda-en-drogas-y-violencia | title=Natasha ahonda en drogas y violencia|website=Eluniversal.com.mx| date=2018-12-28}}</ref> who is also one of its executive producers and writers, and is starring award winner actor [[Daniel Giménez Cacho]] as Fernando Barrientos.<ref>{{Cite web | url=http://pulsoslp.com.mx/2018/09/27/gimenez-cacho-en-un-extrano-enemigo/ | title=Giménez Cacho en "Un extraño enemigo"|website=Pulsolp.com.mx}}</ref> It also stars:
* Antonio de la Vega as Interior Minister [[Luis Echeverría]]<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://news.culturacolectiva.com/mexico/un-extrano-enemigo-la-serie-de-amazon-que-habla-de-los-politicos-en-el-68/|title=¿Quieres saber qué pensaban Díaz Ordaz y Luis Echeverría en el 68?|date=September 27, 2018|website=News.culturacolectiva.com}}</ref>
* Fernando Becerril as Mexico City Mayor [[List of heads of government of Mexico City#Heads of the Federal District Department (Regents)|Alfonso Corona del Rosal]]<ref>{{Cite web | url=http://www.eluniversal.com.mx/espectaculos/farandula/fer-becerril-se-vuelve-un-extrano-enemigo | title=Fer Becerril se vuelve. Un extraño enemigo|website=Eluniversal.com.mx| date=2018-06-16}}</ref>
* Hernán Del Riego as Mexican President [[Gustavo Díaz Ordaz]]<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://news.culturacolectiva.com/mexico/un-extrano-enemigo-serie-de-amazon-que-habla-del-presidente-diaz-ordaz-y-el-68/|title=¿Qué harías si revivieran al presidente Gustavo Díaz Ordaz?|date=August 13, 2018|website=News.culturacolectiva.com}}</ref>
* Karina Gidi as Mrs. Esperanza Barrientos<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://suracapulco.mx/2018/09/27/retratan-en-serie-las-maniobras-politicas-que-llevaron-a-la-masacre-de-tlatelolco/ |title=Retratan en serie las maniobras políticas que llevaron a la masacre de Tlatelolco - el Sur de Acapulco I Periódico de Guerrero » el Sur de Acapulco I Periódico de Guerrero |access-date=2019-01-08 |archive-date=2018-09-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180928044438/https://suracapulco.mx/2018/09/27/retratan-en-serie-las-maniobras-politicas-que-llevaron-a-la-masacre-de-tlatelolco/ |url-status=dead }}</ref>
* [[Kristyan Ferrer]] as Beto a shady student leader<ref>{{Cite web | url=http://www.eluniversal.com.mx/espectaculos/television/kristyan-ferrer-revoltoso-del-68 | title=Kristyan Ferrer, revoltoso del 68|website=Eluniversal.com.mx| date=2018-08-11}}</ref>
* Andrés Delgado as David an important activist leader,<ref>{{Cite web | url=http://www.eluniversal.com.mx/espectaculos/cine/comandante-1968-una-serie-sobre-el-movimiento-estudiantil | title="Un extraño enemigo", una serie inspirada en lo ocurrido durante el 68 en México|website=Eluniversal.com.mx| date=2018-04-26}}</ref> loosely based in the renowned journalist and writer [[Luis González de Alba]].<ref>{{Cite web | url=https://www.timeoutmexico.mx/ciudad-de-mexico/cine/conoce-a-los-personajes-reales-y-ficticios-de-un-extranyo-enemigo | title=Los personajes reales y ficticios de Un extraño enemigo|website=Timeoutmexico.mx}}</ref>
* [[Irene Azuela]] as Elena, Commander Barrientos' assistant, right hand and secret lover.<ref>{{Cite web | url=https://heraldodemexico.com.mx/escena/irene-azuela-rechaza-glorificacion-de-la-mujer/ | title=Irene Azuela rechaza glorificación de la mujer|website=Heraldodemexico.xom.mx| date=2018-09-27}}</ref>

